[{"title":"登胜棋楼","author":"张联桂","text":"蚁聚蜂屯十二秋，谁知重上胜棋楼。\n已随浮世沧桑换，惟见长江日夜流。\n一局楸枰空得失，六朝烟景足句留。\n英雄不及卢家妇，依旧湖名唤莫愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22844,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过虎牙滩","author":"张联桂","text":"连山如门忽对峙，一滩前横石齿齿。\n声振林木惊春雷，势杂风雨奔江水。\n洪涛吸呿吞孤舟，虎牙森锯毋乃似。\n巉岩穿凿铁练垂，篙师攒挽争上驶。\n东风比虎更颠狂，布帆高张疾于矢。\n我启篷窗窥峭壁，摩天苍翠尺有咫。\n回头左顾仙人桥，十二峰背环江涘。\n乘风破浪须臾间，张牙舞爪胡为尔。\n苛政之猛殊未闻，危滩之险已如此。\n嗟尔西行入蜀船，黄牛白狗从兹始。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22845,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚眺","author":"张联桂","text":"极目群峰列画图，落花风里立平芜。\n鸭头春水迷高下，鸦背斜阳倏有无。\n乡思已随云影远，客情犹共月轮孤。\n万家镫火关忧乐，兴尽归来马识途。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22846,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"依韵酬高大伯敦兼简许六仙屏 其一","author":"吴坤修","text":"百战惨何极，藐躬当劫余。\n苍黄事戎马，寂寞置琴书。\n泪为群黎洒，家无担石储。\n自知狂足哂，举世可容予。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22847,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"依韵酬高大伯敦兼简许六仙屏 其二","author":"吴坤修","text":"风义真高古，逢君笑口开。\n俗尘随地是，清气扑人来。\n白社同携酒，黄金更筑台。\n斯文仗维系，珍重出群才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22848,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"依韵酬高大伯敦兼简许六仙屏 其三","author":"吴坤修","text":"吾爱许夫子，传家守一经。\n虚心师绿竹，健翮振苍冥。\n车笠盟如水，干戈鬓欲星。\n故乡尚烽火，何忍向南溟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22849,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再过马当","author":"吴坤修","text":"南州久矣无高阁，江上诗人今又还。\n借一帆风无用处，掀髯空对马当山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22850,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答王戎部孝凤见寄","author":"吴坤修","text":"别去惟余两鬓皤，离怀可奈故人何。\n不堪万里飘零甚，况值中年感慨多。\n夜雨几时同把酒，朔风今日尚横戈。\n千秋独羡鸱夷子，一舸偏能访苎萝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22851,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡边 其一","author":"长善","text":"一年一度按巡边，蓟北渔阳九月天。\n叠叠乱云迷战垒，荒荒古道入溪烟。\n貔貅列戍资专阃，台障经营仰昔贤。\n好趁高秋勤肄武，关河快著祖生鞭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22852,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡边 其二","author":"长善","text":"大漠穷秋草正肥，健儿队队马如飞。\n千旌耀日争前导，羽扇临风效一挥。\n极塞黄尘消客鬓，满山红叶扑征衣。\n建昌东望挑林口，落照长河且驻騑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22853,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡边 其三","author":"长善","text":"去年枹鼓报仓黄，驿骑喧腾羽檄忙。\n稍喜从天下飞将，更闻清野到穷乡。\n数声晓角高峰月，万帐平沙午夜霜。\n自古筹边须善策，令严刁斗重周防。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22854,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡边 其四","author":"长善","text":"柳营迤逦过三屯，见说登坛上将尊。\n绝代勋名埋断碣，多时峰火黯荒村。\n军门已献辽河捷，野戍犹惊旅梦魂。\n三十一关东去远，掌中形胜有谁论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22855,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡边 其五","author":"长善","text":"短衣匹马忆东征，早岁曾经古北平。\n此日扬扬持使节，重来屑屑笑儒生。\n车铃替戾卢龙塞，烟水空濛孤竹城。\n且喜风尘洽亲故，金樽银烛共相迎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22856,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡边 其六","author":"长善","text":"草窃狐鸣剽市阛，团民杀贼诏频颁。\n朝歌设策求才少，魏国忧时刺勇艰。\n岂有萑苻终梗化，尽闻刀笔擅容奸。\n苍茫不尽关山感，又逐燕鸿自往还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22857,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨止","author":"魁玉","text":"积雨檐前歇，风情惬素襟。\n楼头疏柳重，槛外湿云深。\n翠色拥丘壑，泉声通竹林。\n今宵知有月，坐待且横琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22858,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟次高邮","author":"魁玉","text":"才入秦邮浦，征途去正悠。\n人家随岸转，淮水抱城流。\n古塔凌烟耸，轻帆带雨收。\n乡关云树杳，目极使人愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22859,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"快雨得李冰叔大令复书补示客秋赠行旧句次韵却寄","author":"李桓","text":"西园飞盖渺难扳，失喜鱼书快往还。\n慰我停云思霭霭，宜人凉雨况潸潸。\n三秋别绪萦潭水，万里诗情到海山。\n为报烦忧都解脱，一心空洞一身闲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22860,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送王壬秋孝廉入蜀 其一","author":"李桓","text":"言指齐东路，幡然入蜀行。\n招邀皆旧好，慷慨见平生。\n古道谁堪托，奇才不可名。\n慎旃天下险，幕府正论兵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22861,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送王壬秋孝廉入蜀 其二","author":"李桓","text":"小聚忽为别，游踪何日还。\n颓唐吾欲老，气谊晚弥坚。\n指数真知己，心仪属大贤。\n相期各努力，旷世几人传。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22862,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答何青耜咏赠鲈鱼","author":"唐树森","text":"鲈羹风味赖翁知，况值加餐待客时。\n料得濠梁多逸趣，半江红叶换新诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22863,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题","author":"金安清","text":"天际轻阴懒放晴，隔江笳吹动严城。\n乡心对酒愁难醉，倦眼看书老尚明。\n客里交游同骨肉，梦中欢笑又升平。\n吴兴可记山居日，一样前溪折竹声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22864,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄严缁生昆季","author":"金安清","text":"峨峨巨舰驾空行，万壑千岩络绎迎。\n赤壁自关天下险，黄楼不负古来名。\n遭时将吏功终就，失路英雄世尚争。\n搔首临风漫惆怅，《南华》鹏鴳等浮生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22865,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泛舟遇雨","author":"崇祐","text":"满天风雨促舟回，万顷波涛雪浪堆。\n半幅蒲帆两枝桨，诗人已自画中来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22866,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜临湖上","author":"崇祐","text":"凉宵一雨快新晴，洗出江容万里清。\n天际帆樯秋自远，水边楼阁月初明。\n深溪风闪渔镫影，野寺云流佛磬声。\n俯仰无言人寂寂，小舟闲在藕塘横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22867,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过之罘岛至烟台观海楼登眺","author":"斌椿","text":"山势郁崔嵬，之罘入海来。\n鲛人货珠贝，蜃气幻楼台。\n岛峙千屏列，波平一镜开。\n登高思琢句，恨乏谪仙才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22868,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄杨简侯表弟","author":"斌椿","text":"五年林下纵清谈，策马西陲我未堪。\n今日定教君艳羡，杏花时节在江南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22869,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早行","author":"宗韶","text":"曙色来天外，征衫怯晓风。\n马行残月下，人在乱山中。\n石侧蚕丛险，烟开鸟道通。\n思乡心更切，前路尚飘蓬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22870,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀李骁骑伊犁","author":"宗韶","text":"故人天末去，秋至未言归。\n不见锦笺到，又看黄叶飞。\n寒风侵板屋，明月满征衣。\n为问从戎客，何时始合围。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22871,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中作","author":"宗韶","text":"孤负黄花九月天，病多渐与酒无缘。\n妻贫犹问饔飧来，仆猾偏侵药饵钱。\n愁极妄思千日醉，夜长静对一镫眠。\n登临妒杀西山客，碧嶂丹枫锦样鲜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22872,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"废宅行","author":"宗韶","text":"瞻云坊北大市南，其间道路我所谙。\n路傍废宅怆心目，试问故老犹能谈。\n老人今年八十余，自言犹记创造初。\n达官归来富囊橐，锄茅平地营新居。\n移山种树穷人力，千夫昼夜无休息。\n沈檀为户楠作梁，金碧楼台华丽极。\n重楼十楹藏美人，美人分占名园春。\n笙歌昼酣乱细语，罗绮夜舞生香尘。\n春来秋去光阴速，过眼豪华如转毂。\n歌声未已哭声哀，隙地犹余未完屋。\n比来居者复三迁，草满平池卧白莲。\n旧日夕阳穿绣户，经年积雨塌花塼。\n贫者难居富者弃，修葺不成拆毁易。\n美人不见画楼平，兴衰见惯浑闲事。\n桑田沧海有变更，世间万事浮云轻。\n达官墓道荒草满，不复宰树遮天青。\n君不见昨日牛车载大木，又向谁家筑华屋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22873,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梓潼道上","author":"宗韶","text":"山色依天尽，开眸意豁然。\n风高云薄命，道古树延年。\n冬水碧无底，夕阳红可怜。\n回头谢奇险，一为驻吟鞭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22874,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日过龙泉寺","author":"李江","text":"百岁几今日，循溪来上方。\n水流山影活，风过叶声凉。\n晚果经霜赤，秋瓜卧地黄。\n道人知爱菊，篱畔未全荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22875,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"徐志源","text":"已是萧萧落叶声，更闻孤雁客心惊。\n关山到处多矰缴，冷月凄风况独征。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22876,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浭阳早发","author":"徐志源","text":"鸡声啼不住，催客上征车。\n瘦马踏残月，荒城起戍笳。\n稀疏星数点，隐约路三叉。\n地白天将晓，寒风散早鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22877,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜泊","author":"王庆勋","text":"远树团烟密，孤帆带露收。\n江潮三港入，渔火一星浮。\n乡梦围新月，风声逼晚秋。\n清笳何处起，哀挟暮云流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22878,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浒墅关夜雨","author":"王庆勋","text":"篷背潇潇雨，更深洒未停。\n湿云围岸黑，残梦逼镫青。\n夜永沈街柝，风尖飐塔铃。\n邻舟歌水调，倚枕不堪听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22879,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同棣庵泉孙游豫园","author":"王庆勋","text":"石气连湖气，斜阳并入秋。\n潮声争港出，云影抱城流。\n客访花三径，入薰酒一楼。\n溪山真不俗，最好是清游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22880,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"红桥舟中即景","author":"王庆勋","text":"芳树丛丛合，春光簇眼前。\n潮争桥路狭，船护柳阴圆。\n云划天边雨，村拦草际烟。\n篷窗无个事，兄弟对床眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22881,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奣子桥舟夜","author":"王庆勋","text":"林黑疑无路，扁舟触浪回。\n泪多怜短烛，酒劣畏深杯。\n新月排云出，残钟渡水来。\n今宵诗梦健，飞过钓鱼台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22882,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同东野夜话","author":"王庆勋","text":"春来最易触愁根，往事从头仔细论。\n劫外莺花伤杜牧，眼中人物笑桓温。\n江湖难许寻诗梦，风雨犹堪数酒痕。\n随意杯盘知未俗，为邀明月不关门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22883,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夕舟中书怀","author":"王庆勋","text":"肯负江边月，篷窗灭烛看。\n风筛虫语细，云裹雁声寒。\n吮笔诗初就，倾杯酒已残。\n今宵归梦阻，都被乱峰拦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22884,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸丑除夕时寄居双忠庵","author":"文汉光","text":"萧条破寺寄寒毡，收拾闲堂肃祭筵。\n尚著黑貂存汉腊，愁听白鹤语尧年。\n拈花偶契佛三昧，缚草拚装鬼一船。\n剩有遗书藏复壁，来朝开帙理新篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22885,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀存庄","author":"文汉光","text":"秋风动淮泗，万叶已纷飞。\n昨夜闻征雁，寒霜照铁衣。\n兵戈官道梗，患难故交稀。\n共有思亲泪，何当并辔归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22886,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"许州题壁","author":"姚庆恩","text":"敝车破笠抟风沙，襄许历历情如麻。\n树云四面绿压地，黄莺一声春无涯。\n忽见人家在坡底，闲向青山傲朱邸。\n俗尘常垢奔波人，那得洒然山雨洗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22887,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"抵丹徒","author":"姚庆恩","text":"何人重此辟蒿莱，北固南徐想霸才。\n万顷江光天外落，六朝山色枕边来。\n波恬八表鱼龙静，云满阡冈草木哀。\n客里马周谁更识，只同乌帽溷尘埃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22888,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次邢台","author":"姚庆恩","text":"一望旌旗杂戍谯，寒沙莽莽路迢迢。\n长虹贯日荆轲水，满马悲风豫让桥。\n台上黄金能买士，樽前红粉可怜宵。\n感今抚昔苍凉甚，惟有诗情未寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22889,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳","author":"姚庆恩","text":"千章犹滞绿相招，前度秋风客意萧。\n吹笛桥边将进酒，凝妆楼上可怜宵。\n白门词曲黄金缕，红板烟花碧玉条。\n十五纤腰新宛转，不逢京兆也魂销。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22890,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杜村早发磁州","author":"姚庆恩","text":"邯郸何事梦纷纭，醒眼真空冀北群。\n杨柳绿沈临水雾，蘼芜青拥出山云。\n一枝殷浩铁如意，十幅羊欣白练裙。\n不爱美人偏爱酒，陶潜还逊信陵君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22891,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沔阳州","author":"姚庆恩","text":"景唐杰阁汉州舟，佳气葱茏据上游。\n一叶蒲帆三尺水，东风吹过沔阳州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22892,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠丁翘山","author":"姚庆恩","text":"仰止丁南羽，穷边始识君。\n清才葱岭雪，归梦岳州云。\n不俗官难达，多愁酒易醺。\n疏留辞主帅，春水绿沄沄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22893,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为毛煦初冢宰题毕秋帆宫保遗照","author":"姚庆恩","text":"麟阁须眉回不侔，丹青迟我识君侯。\n人皆白发归田老，士已黄金泻水酬。\n千里觚棱湘楚节，十年风月灞陵秋。\n买丝欲向灵岩绣，翠嶂藏书字字愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22894,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与张朗帅同作","author":"姚庆恩","text":"孤鸿啼月不堪闻，葱岭榆关障宿氛。\n漏网尚稽铜马贼，射潮遥忆水犀军。\n才如白傅犹沦落，手缚乌孙告大勋。\n烟水五湖原有约，让人凭吊望诸君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22895,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"率舟师出虎门捕盗","author":"文星瑞","text":"此地咸称百谷王，虎门东下接重洋。\n地穷炎徼千峰赭，天混诸蛮一气苍。\n夜静鱼龙惊鼓角，风高凫雁送帆樯。\n微躯敢惜垂堂戒，要剪萑苻靖一方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22896,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜眷属至自广州兼怀咏轩弟高州 其一","author":"文星瑞","text":"才别已三月，今来又一方。\n风霜惊岁晚，弱小虑途长。\n未见情偏切，相逢话转忘。\n翻思前夕梦，江路月茫茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22897,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜眷属至自广州兼怀咏轩弟高州 其二","author":"文星瑞","text":"婢仆登堂喜，儿童绕屋哗。\n待温家酿酒，留赏岁寒花。\n得失无穷事，羁栖到处家。\n独怜姜被冷，咫尺似天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22898,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"珠江春泛","author":"文星瑞","text":"冶游风景似江南，佳节欣逢三月三。\n千队红妆万枝桨，桃花春水白鹅潭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22899,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自藤县至容县道中书所见","author":"文星瑞","text":"峰峦塞虚空，去天仅盈掌。\n江流百千折，势束不得放。\n两崖蔽深丛，烟云色莽苍。\n日光忽相射，空绿互回荡。\n轻舠入其中，狭隘若瓮盎。\n岩隙悬修縆，一发青梯上。\n十里九回却，颠倒作非想。\n稍稍露汀洲，豁然境开朗。\n篷窗澹无事，爱此秋气爽。\n回睇所来处，转觉袖惝恍。\n缚茅三两屋，隔树午舂响。\n忘机沙上禽，无鱼独来往。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22900,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"到廉州始闻秋风用刘随州韵","author":"文星瑞","text":"海角萍踪千里至，天涯霜信一时回。\n连山夜火金蛇走，动地秋声铁骑来。\n羌笛吹残杨柳变，寒砧催报菊花开。\n呼鹰跃马平生意，落日苍茫上古台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22901,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"徐孺子亭","author":"文星瑞","text":"东汉党人盛，翛然能独醒。\n青天何皎皎，一鹤在空冥。\n高士已长往，南州余此亭。\n白蘋满湖上，我欲荐芳馨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22902,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸亥仲秋游狼山饭于白衣庵","author":"耿苍龄","text":"观海难为水，登山半是仙。\n未从赤松隐，来证白衣禅。\n净土疑无地，层楼别有天。\n消愁一杯酒，归路夕阳边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22903,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和白香亭留别原韵","author":"耿苍龄","text":"春水绿波春日迟，频年相隔更相思。\n清泉明月王维画，渭树江云杜甫诗。\n父老犹传悬晓镜，故人空说涤吟卮。\n迁乔此去长如愿，惭愧吴侬两鬓丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22904,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚步","author":"罗萱","text":"凉风起孤馆，池水动微波。\n野径夕阳没，远山秋色多。\n归禽寻故木，积暝入烟萝。\n芒屦归来晚，镫前生浩歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22905,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"彭泽怀靖节先生","author":"罗萱","text":"扁舟一叶泛江天，坐忆先生旷代贤。\n乞食不妨轻五斗，高情何止邈千年。\n自搔短鬓秋风里，谁种幽花细雨边。\n归就东篱作重九，南山相对亦悠然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":22906,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]